	(text "J4 -> Raspberry Pi 5 header\n1 +5V  -> pin 2       6 MOSI -> pin 19 (GPIO10)\n2 +5V  -> pin 4       7 GND  -> pin 20\n3 GND  -> pin 6       8 SCLK -> pin 23 (GPIO11)\n4 GND  -> pin 9       9 CE0  -> pin 24 (GPIO8)\n5 GND  -> pin 14\nShort 22AWG dupont wires; keep both 5V and all GND wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
